<item>
<title>独家丨阿维塔酝酿高层调整：董事长王辉已开始负责长安海外业务</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/transportation/K2A5u6HhCSr6HH9d.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: center;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ed3762417.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg" data-ratio="0.18" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" type="block" data-backw="578" data-backh="104" data-imgfileid="504268953" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ed3762417.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px -10px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0px;text-align: right;line-height: 25.6px;visibility: visible;"></section></section><section style="margin-top: 16px;"><section data-mpa-action-id="mtwntv5a1y3b" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span mpa-font-style="mtwntlvw1kcj" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mtwntu2m1z9a"><section data-mpa-action-id="mtwo16st1kmv" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtwo16smw4p" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">雷峰网独家获悉，阿维塔科技正在酝酿新一轮高层调整，现任阿维塔科技董事长王辉已被调去负责长安汽车集团海外业务。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtwo16smcw3" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">据雷峰网了解，在内部系统中，王辉目前仍是阿维塔科技董事长，但他的精力已转向长安的海外，目前已开始负责长安的东南亚和中南美业务。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtwo16sm1j9u" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">与此同时，现任长安汽车副总裁、阿维塔科技总裁陈卓，预计将进一步掌管阿维塔相关业务的管理范畴。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtwo16sm1od2" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">据透露，王辉一年前上任阿维塔董事长的核心任务是推动阿维塔完成 IPO，目前&nbsp;IPO&nbsp;正常推进中。与此同时，王辉也是长安体系内较早、较坚定推动与华为合作的重要高管之一。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtwo16sm11su" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">而陈卓，同样是长安汽车重点培养的少壮派高管，他在今年 6 月 15 日被正式聘为长安汽车副总裁，一同成为副总裁的还有现掌管启源汽车的狄智睿。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span style="font-family:mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica Neue, PingFang SC, Hiragino Sans GB, Microsoft YaHei UI, Microsoft YaHei, Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 15px;font-variant-ligatures: normal;letter-spacing: 0.5px;white-space-collapse: collapse;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtwo6asq15qg" style="font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 15px;" data-mpa-action-id="mtwo6asx1w0i" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-weight: bold;">本文作者长期关注自动驾驶和车圈的人与事，欢迎添加微信 jinyuan-0428 交流讨论。</span></span></span></span><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtwo16sm11su" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"></span></section></section></span></span></section></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 32px;" nodeleaf=""><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-aistatus="1" data-backh="710" data-backw="578" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg7T587wSOGicpkicfuzsTSzXDKDDrkoiceGzHqeykRfvlLO9t2WaVGYFwvic44iaOJNeiaEPbmxXGW0kFvk4GhDFsIfgEBIWKz2iaz2H0/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="578" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="710" data-imgfileid="504272769" data-ratio="1.228" data-s="300,640" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ed37c5628.png" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width: 100%;background-color: transparent;"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ed37c5628.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr38q9h31fs1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-data-temp-type="historyRecommend" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr38qm3y1knu" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;display: flex;color: rgb(224, 98, 43);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);justify-content: center;align-items: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.6em;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">▼</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;line-height: 1.6em;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">推荐阅读</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.6em;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">▼</span></section></section></section><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mqp1n1o01w6w" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section><section data-recommend-type="list-normal" data-recommend-tid="2" data-mpa-template="t" style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid="" data-from="yb-recommend" data-mpa-action-id="mtwnssfoy77" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="width: 100%;padding: 14px 7px 6px;background: #ffffff;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #e8e8eb;" data-mid=""><section data-mpa-template="t" data-recommend-article-type="list-normal" data-recomment-template-id="2" data-recommend-article-id="2651756543_1" data-recommend-article-time="1788939299" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ACzflXDibhg6p3U1Kpbbzibyib2KfrnCH8rbBvaPg00NU41OjVibY82wBfpOsmYrXj4kjI0cIRgAZkicHe7qnicsvh4pDn952NrRqOJOlvH2MVZVE/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="独家丨蔚来李斌最新内部讲话：明年将有重量级新车，未来3年的核心是三个聚焦" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qfTBlV7yPnpQxXNzHfDnOA"><section data-recommend-content="t" style="width: 100%;padding: 5px 10px;background: #f9f9f9;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #efefef;margin-bottom: 8px;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="margin-right: 12px;flex: 1;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" style="font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #333333;line-height: 18px;margin-bottom: 20px;max-width: 100%;overflow: hidden;display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 2;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651756543&idx=1&sn=46c5f75a4804256634cb41d390798415&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #333333;">独家丨蔚来李斌最新内部讲话：明年将有重量级新车，未来3年的核心是三个聚焦</span></a></span></p><p data-recommend-date="t" style="max-width: 100%;font-size: 11px;font-weight: 400;color: #999999;line-height: 16px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">2026-09-09</span></p></section><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651756543&idx=1&sn=46c5f75a4804256634cb41d390798415&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ed37edbd7.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.0026455026455026" data-w="378" style="width: 51px;object-fit: cover;height: 51px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ed37edbd7.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" data-recommend-article-type="list-normal" data-recomment-template-id="2" data-recommend-article-id="1000007493_2" data-recommend-article-time="1788913226" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ACzflXDibhg7gYjvuwCWtv2r2wlAl4TLvbMnibGAeeE9Eq5GB2CX1fZofjA8bUOJBDKSZS4ibUxlO01rwtgYYemL1kyHbbKiakQYtPk5b3ufXpc/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="独家丨舒酉星创立新公司「星能远行」，此前是比亚迪欧洲总裁" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OdP9OA7k2Urza2fII8yFDA"><section data-recommend-content="t" style="width: 100%;padding: 5px 10px;background: #f9f9f9;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #efefef;margin-bottom: 8px;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="margin-right: 12px;flex: 1;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" style="font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #333333;line-height: 18px;margin-bottom: 20px;max-width: 100%;overflow: hidden;display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 2;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651756518&idx=2&sn=31317c7572ba1c79802ebbb94e6a8ab0&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #333333;">独家丨舒酉星创立新公司「星能远行」，此前是比亚迪欧洲总裁</span></a></span></p><p data-recommend-date="t" style="max-width: 100%;font-size: 11px;font-weight: 400;color: #999999;line-height: 16px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">2026-09-09</span></p></section><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651756518&idx=2&sn=31317c7572ba1c79802ebbb94e6a8ab0&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ed381b34c.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.0026246719160106" data-w="381" style="width: 51px;object-fit: cover;height: 51px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ed381b34c.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
