<item>
<title>独家丨舒酉星创立新公司「星能远行」，此前是比亚迪欧洲总裁</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/transportation/Mq2kLln4ozKgC9Kv.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: center;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ecbf203bc.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg" data-ratio="0.18" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" type="block" data-backw="578" data-backh="104" data-imgfileid="504268953" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ecbf203bc.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px -10px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0px;text-align: right;line-height: 25.6px;visibility: visible;"></section></section><section style="margin-top: 16px;"><section data-mpa-action-id="mtsl1414kcr" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span mpa-font-style="mtsl0nbeo1q" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mtsl12la50o"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x174s" style="font-size: 15px;">雷峰网独家获悉，比亚迪前高管舒酉星近期成立了新公司，该公司名为星能远行科技（深圳）有限公司，成立于2026年8月16日，注册资本500万元，舒酉星为法定代表人并持股100%。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x1qmi" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">雷峰网了解到，星能远行注册地位于深圳市龙岗区，所属行业为新能源技术推广服务。目前公司股东及高管结构较为简单，除舒酉星外，章安若担任监事。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x1oeb" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">值得注意的是，星能远行成立的时间点，与舒酉星近期从比亚迪相关工商主体退出高度接近。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140xqpn" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2026年，舒酉星已卸任比亚迪丰田电动车科技有限公司董事一职，由比亚迪集团董事会秘书、投资处总经理李黔接替。比亚迪丰田成立于2020年，由比亚迪与丰田各持股50%，主要负责纯电动车研发。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x5v6" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">结合此次新公司成立以及此前的职务变动，舒酉星或已正式离开比亚迪，开启个人创业。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x1zqb" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">舒酉星在比亚迪已经工作近27年。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140xgg4" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">1999年从清华大学化学工程专业毕业后，舒酉星加入比亚迪，从工艺科科长、销售经理、光电子项目部经理做起，随后进入比亚迪电子业务核心管理层，先后担任通讯电子研究院常务副院长、电子研究院院长以及事业部总经理等职务。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x20rt" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这段经历也让舒酉星早期深度参与了比亚迪电子、制造及供应链体系的建设。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140xm5o" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2015年，舒酉星开始转向汽车业务，接替侯雁出任比亚迪汽车销售有限公司总经理。此后，他又担任比亚迪汽车智慧生态研究院院长，参与推动比亚迪汽车智能化、车联网以及开放生态建设。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x1h9k" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2017年前后，比亚迪开始推动DiLink以及D++开放平台等智能汽车生态，舒酉星也成为这一阶段的重要业务负责人之一。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x9nf" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">随后，舒酉星将工作重心转向海外。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140xb02" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2022年，比亚迪正式启动欧洲新能源乘用车业务时，舒酉星担任比亚迪国际合作事业部兼欧洲汽车销售事业部总经理，并成为比亚迪欧洲业务最核心的负责人之一。公开资料显示，他曾代表比亚迪参与欧洲市场发布、渠道拓展以及本地化建设等工作。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x102h" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2023年，舒酉星公开表示，比亚迪新能源乘用车已经进入15个欧洲国家，并在英国、德国、法国、意大利、西班牙等市场建立超过140家门店。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x24mp" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">到2024年，比亚迪欧洲业务进一步扩张。舒酉星曾参与比亚迪在欧洲本地化生产和供应链布局的讨论，并公开表示，比亚迪希望在匈牙利建立本地供应网络，进一步推进欧洲业务本土化。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x2v0" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">2024年10月的巴黎车展上，舒酉星仍以比亚迪欧洲汽车销售事业部总经理身份公开亮相。他当时表示，两年间比亚迪已经进入欧洲20多个国家及地区，并从最初的三款车型扩展至八款车型。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x1l9o" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">如今，舒酉星选择离开工作了近27年的比亚迪，成立一家注册资本500万元的新能源技术推广公司。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140x11uv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">目前，星能远行的具体业务方向尚未公开。不过，从公司名称、工商登记的“新能源技术推广服务”以及舒酉星过去长期横跨电子、汽车、新能源和海外市场的经历来看，其创业方向大概率仍与新能源产业链及汽车产业存在较强关联。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="mtsl0nbe8ca" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="mtsl12lagn6"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="mtsl140xc9y" style="font-size: 15px;">对于一位在比亚迪工作近27年的资深高管而言，这或许意味着职业身份的一次重要切换：从比亚迪内部的业务开拓者，转向新能源产业中的独立创业者。</span></span></span></section></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 32px;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ecbf81531.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.228" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width: 100%;background-color: transparent;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg7T587wSOGicpkicfuzsTSzXDKDDrkoiceGzHqeykRfvlLO9t2WaVGYFwvic44iaOJNeiaEPbmxXGW0kFvk4GhDFsIfgEBIWKz2iaz2H0/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="578" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="710" data-backw="578" data-backh="710" data-imgfileid="504272769" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ecbf81531.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr38q9h31fs1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-data-temp-type="historyRecommend" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr38qm3y1knu" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;display: flex;color: rgb(224, 98, 43);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);justify-content: center;align-items: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.6em;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">▼</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;line-height: 1.6em;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">推荐阅读</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.6em;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">▼</span></section></section></section><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mqp1n1o01w6w" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section><section data-recommend-type="list-normal" data-recommend-tid="2" data-mpa-template="t" style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid="" data-from="yb-recommend" data-mpa-action-id="mtskzkp91fpp" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="width: 100%;padding: 14px 7px 6px;background: #ffffff;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #e8e8eb;" data-mid=""><section data-mpa-template="t" data-recommend-article-type="list-normal" data-recomment-template-id="2" data-recommend-article-id="1000007492_1" data-recommend-article-time="1788859800" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ACzflXDibhg4IfETwIibusQCT06QTZVp0eGRPo0blic1iamoxBRnACTW8lOXk1yYpHJqq5HhiblF3CY4PmyXBJzWMpZ8v2hpuj74VxicYOxV75Z5k/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="对话蔚来创始人李斌：蔚来单车均价比奥迪贵18万，比宝马贵七八万，比奔驰贵数万" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/s2Hib5N9mFrWNTfhjhOONw"><section data-recommend-content="t" style="width: 100%;padding: 5px 10px;background: #f9f9f9;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #efefef;margin-bottom: 8px;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="margin-right: 12px;flex: 1;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" style="font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #333333;line-height: 18px;margin-bottom: 20px;max-width: 100%;overflow: hidden;display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 2;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651756484&idx=1&sn=6cd5f6604139e83d325bfa8b2b81c502&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #333333;">对话蔚来创始人李斌：蔚来单车均价比奥迪贵18万，比宝马贵七八万，比奔驰贵数万</span></a></span></p><p data-recommend-date="t" style="max-width: 100%;font-size: 11px;font-weight: 400;color: #999999;line-height: 16px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">2026-09-08</span></p></section><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651756484&idx=1&sn=6cd5f6604139e83d325bfa8b2b81c502&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ecbfa493b.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.0026315789473683" data-w="380" style="width: 51px;object-fit: cover;height: 51px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ecbfa493b.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" data-recommend-article-type="list-normal" data-recomment-template-id="2" data-recommend-article-id="1000007454_1" data-recommend-article-time="1787567726" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/ACzflXDibhg4n9kosSnlYLO5F9hCBoMiaX9WibwVdACHxHib1oI4JKwIXxbDOZfdNhZKmZxXU5x45Pkk97hsQ0RiaWe4BLDDp02wwkbo3Ya6Xfw0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="独家丨任少卿创立具身公司，蔚来将成新公司战略股东" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GpXuuWY9VlARCXuYD9qIMQ"><section data-recommend-content="t" style="width: 100%;padding: 5px 10px;background: #f9f9f9;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #efefef;margin-bottom: 8px;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="margin-right: 12px;flex: 1;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" style="font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #333333;line-height: 18px;margin-bottom: 20px;max-width: 100%;overflow: hidden;display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 2;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651755196&idx=1&sn=8f72091453cb303bc3457af3e541b222&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #333333;">独家丨任少卿创立具身公司，蔚来将成新公司战略股东</span></a></span></p><p data-recommend-date="t" style="max-width: 100%;font-size: 11px;font-weight: 400;color: #999999;line-height: 16px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">2026-08-24</span></p></section><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651755196&idx=1&sn=8f72091453cb303bc3457af3e541b222&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ecbfc97c7.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.0026315789473683" data-w="380" style="width: 51px;object-fit: cover;height: 51px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261010/6ac9ecbfc97c7.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
