e: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC NEW&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(246, 248, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="font-weight: normal">为了方便大家抱团交流、互通会议消息，我们专门建了</span><span textstyle="" style="font-weight: bold">&nbsp;IROS</span></span><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;">&nbsp;2026</span></strong><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="font-weight: bold">&nbsp;参会交流群</span></span></strong><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="font-weight: normal">！进群你会解锁这些「福利」</span>?</span></strong></p><ul style="list-style-type: square;" class=" list-paddingleft-2"><li><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 16px 16px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;flex-direction: column;align-self: flex-start;background: #F6F8FF;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">会议情报站</span></span><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;flex-direction: column;align-self: flex-start;background: #F6F8FF;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">：</span></span><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="font-weight: normal">投稿 DDL、格式规范、评审进度……关键节点第一时间送达，再也不怕错过 deadline，投稿准备稳稳的。</span></span></strong></p></li><li><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 16px 16px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;flex-direction: column;align-self: flex-start;background: #F6F8FF;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">同行茶话会</span></span><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;flex-direction: column;align-self: flex-start;background: #F6F8FF;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">：</span></span><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="font-weight: normal">天南海北的同行都在群里，聊心得、碰思路、攒人脉，科研路上我们同行。</span></span></strong></p></li><li><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 16px 16px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;"><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;flex-direction: column;align-self: flex-start;background: #F6F8FF;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">前沿补给站</span></span><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;flex-direction: column;align-self: flex-start;background: #F6F8FF;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.75em;font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7; font-weight: bold">：</span></span><span leaf="" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: ;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 15px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="font-weight: normal">最新研究成果、热点方向实时同步，结合会议主题帮你捋清投稿脉络，给论文灵感加满油。</span></span></strong></p></li><li><p style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);margin: 16px 16px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !impo